ion and  killer well he's mildly imposing  a bit of a dick as well using marie to  last her out  and all of that thing although i do  really like his magic scale magic seems  so incredibly useful and it makes me  wonder well  where the hell were you during the whole  reincarnation thing a man who can  balance the magic of enemies would have  been mighty useful against all of those  extremely op elves  damn it damnatio but word of aster's  trial spreads surprisingly suddenly to  the point where he has his own newspaper  article with this like very flattering  picture actually it makes arsenal look a  lot better than he has ever appeared  elsewhere in black clover sort of like  they've applied to bishon and filter to  the image  in this newspaper astor is quite  literally a handsome devil however this  whole trial business does lead to my  favorite moment of the arc where the  black bulls burst into magical  parliament which is the most harry  potter thing i've heard in the series  yet but initially we have two pages of  close-ups on obscure and mostly  unidentifiable parts of their bodies  however you can tell who each member is  by their dialogue which i love  i think it's great that we've gotten to  the point where we know this squad so  well that they can be identified  by speech alone except for vanessa who  is obviously  tits incarnate so her close up is going  to be her natural cliff face but then we  have what i think is the greatest group  shot of the black balls or even black  clover characters in general to this  point and all around this section just  acted as a mighty big payoff to the  story so far  seeing all of these friends and comrades  that asked her had painstakingly earned  showing up to save him it's a nice  reversal of you know the standard  situation with the ultimate conclusion  being  we're going on a road trip asta and the  black bulls are saved via  a banishment mission which leads us into  the next section of the ark seeking out  knowledge